flowchart TD
  Q1["Which software sent this request?"]
  Q1 --> P1["Web Bot Auth (IETF draft),<br/>RFC 9421 signatures"]

  P1 --> Q2["Which client app and user session,<br/>with which scopes?"]
  Q2 --> P2["OAuth 2.1, as used by<br/>MCP authorization"]

  P2 --> Q3["Whose representative is this,<br/>why did it come,<br/>what may it do here,<br/>and how has it behaved?"]
  Q3 --> P3["Shōkai"]

  P3 --> Q4["Which tools and data can it use?"]
  Q4 --> P4["MCP"]

  P4 --> Q5["How do agents work together<br/>on a task?"]
  Q5 --> P5["A2A"]

  P5 --> Q6["A personal agent working<br/>with a company"]
  Q6 --> P6["Personal Agent Protocol (draft)<br/>and PACT"]

  P6 --> Q7["Is this payment authorized?"]
  Q7 --> P7["AP2 and Agentic<br/>Commerce Protocol"]

  P7 --> Q8["Issuer-backed identity<br/>and delegation?"]
  Q8 --> P8["KYA-OS and x401"]

  classDef shokai fill:#2c4a6c,stroke:#2c4a6c,color:#fbf9f4
  class P3 shokai
